WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.415
Hi! I'm Momo. Let's practice Have you ever…?.

2
00:00:05.815 --> 00:00:07.039
ever

3
00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:08.704
yet

4
00:00:09.104 --> 00:00:10.743
a chance to

5
00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.418
Have you ever been to London?

6
00:00:13.818 --> 00:00:16.312
I've always wanted to try that.

7
00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:19.062
I haven't had a chance yet.

8
00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:21.681
I've never tried surfing.

9
00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:24.416
I've visited London twice.

10
00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.090
Have you ever been to London?

11
00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.615
Yes, I've visited London twice.

12
00:00:31.015 --> 00:00:32.624
When did you go?

13
00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:36.389
Last summer. Have you been there?

14
00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:41.323
Remember this expression. I haven't had a chance yet.

15
00:00:41.723 --> 00:00:48.438
Great job! Pause, repeat, and make it your own. See you in the next lesson!
